/* ===== Portfolio: Lead generation ===== */
[`Richard — Lead Generation Work`]: `Richard — Hasil Lead Generation`,
[`Lead magnet strategy, CRM data management and outreach via meeting calls: the system behind a steady flow of qualified leads.`]: `Strategi lead magnet, pengelolaan data CRM, dan outreach lewat meeting call: sistem di balik aliran lead berkualitas yang stabil.`,
[`Real work, real data`]: `Kerja nyata, data nyata`,
[`lead gen`]: `lead gen`,
