[`Targeted prospect lists — B2B companies by segment, e.g. consultancies, accounting firms, law firms, SaaS and manufacturing in Indonesia, or eldercare and physiotherapy providers in Singapore.`]: `<b>Daftar prospek tertarget</b> — perusahaan B2B per segmen, mis. konsultan, kantor akuntan, firma hukum, SaaS, dan manufaktur di Indonesia, atau penyedia perawatan lansia dan fisioterapi di Singapura.`,
[`Complete, verified records — company, PIC, email, phone, address, industry and the source of every contact.`]: `<b>Data lengkap dan terverifikasi</b> — perusahaan, PIC, email, telepon, alamat, industri, dan sumber setiap kontak.`,
[`Multi-channel tracking — which channel each lead was reached on: email, WhatsApp, Instagram or LinkedIn.`]: `<b>Pelacakan multi-channel</b> — lead dihubungi lewat channel apa: email, WhatsApp, Instagram, atau LinkedIn.`,
[`Outreach log — contacted date, response and next follow-up date for every outreach step.`]: `<b>Log outreach</b> — tanggal dihubungi, respons, dan tanggal follow-up berikutnya untuk setiap langkah outreach.`,
[`Clean pipeline — invalid emails flagged, rejections marked, approvals checked before outreach.`]: `<b>Pipeline yang bersih</b> — email tidak valid ditandai, penolakan dicatat, dan persetujuan dicek sebelum outreach.`,
